# Allow list for copilot-click.
# One Python regular expression per line. A live click happens only when the
# text recognized above the button matches a pattern. Blank lines and lines
# starting with # are ignored. Invalid patterns are skipped and reported.
#
# Copy this file to allow.txt (that copy is gitignored) and keep each pattern
# specific to a command you are willing to auto-allow. If allow.txt is missing
# or has no usable patterns, nothing is clicked unless you pass --trust-all.
#
# Patterns are searched, not full-matched, unless you anchor them with ^ and $.

^git status$
^git diff( --stat)?$
^npm test$
